Extracted data
--------------
data/argspecs.json and data/argspec_print_names.json are generated by running the
real tools and recording their output (scripts/gen_argspecs.py,
scripts/gen_print_names.py).

src/krikri/builtin_module_names_data.cr and
src/krikri/collection_runtime_data.cr embed data extracted at build time from a
pinned ansible-core release and a pinned collection set - the builtin module name
and redirect tables, each collection's release version and routing tables, and
the deprecated ansible.module_utils imports its module/action payloads make
(scripts/gen_builtin_runtime_data.py, scripts/gen_collection_runtime_data.py).
Those generators are development tooling; the shipped binary reads neither an
ansible-core nor a collections installation.

